OL,6,     FShopping from Home.
OL,7,G0610 Inside the Ambulance
OL,8,     FThe Stoke crews cope with a major
OL,9,     Fheart attack and a nasty football
OL,10,     Finjury, while in Dudley, the
OL,11,     Fparamedics help an elderly
OL,12,     Fdiabetic man with severe stomach
OL,13,     Fpains.
OL,14,G0700 Inside the Ambulance
OL,15,     FThe paramedic crews treat a drug
OL,16,     Fuser with a burst abscess, an
OL,17,     Felderly woman whose face has
OL,18,     Fswollen, and a distraught young
OL,19,     Fwoman who may be suffering a
OL,20,     Fmiscarriage.
